sequenceDiagram
  actor R as Rider
  participant M as Live Map
  participant D as Done Today
  participant A as My Account
  participant S as Server
  R->>M: 1: Tap Live Map
  M->>S: 2: GET /api/map (own trip only)
  S-->>M: 3: Station, own stops, sidecar, route
  R->>D: 4: Tap Done Today
  D->>S: 5: GET /api/rider/done-today
  S-->>D: 6: Delivered today, paid and unpaid totals, orders list
  R->>A: 7: Tap My Account
  A-->>R: 8: Profile, change password, log out
